Comment: The application is linked against the LVGL based cp0_lvgl runtime of the
 CardputerZero launcher by M5Stack (Copyright M5Stack Technology CO LTD, MIT) and LVGL
 (Copyright LVGL Kft, MIT), which are part of the binary and are therefore listed in
 its Copyright field below. The fonts it draws with are the launcher's, read at run
 time from /usr/share/APPLaunch/share/font (Montserrat: SIL OFL 1.1; DejaVu: the
 Bitstream Vera / DejaVu licence; Noto Sans CJK: SIL OFL 1.1); none is shipped in this
 package. At run time it runs curl (curl licence, MIT-style) to fetch the feeds; curl
 is not shipped in this package. The feed parser, the HTML to text conversion and the
 store are the app's own code. Feed content belongs to its publishers: it is fetched
 and shown on the device only, never mirrored or re-hosted; the pictures of the
 articles are kept on the device only (an image cache, the saved articles).
 .
 Pictures (JPEG, PNG, GIF, BMP) are decoded by stb_image v2.30 (Copyright 2017 Sean
 Barrett and the stb contributors; public domain / MIT, either at your choice), one
 header compiled into the binary. LVGL's own lodepng (Copyright Lode Vandevenne, zlib
 licence) is also linked into the binary but the app does not use it.

